      ":question/problem": "Consider the matrix $X,$ given by\n\n$$\nX=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -4 & -4 \\\\ 5 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 8 & 5 & -1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nWhat matrix results from carrying out the row operation ${R}_{3}:={R}_{3}-5{R}_{2}$ on $X?$",
